        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an elite Enterprise Sales Assistant. Analyze the incoming lead from our website form and perform two tasks.\n\nIncoming Lead Data:\n- Name: {{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.first_name }} {{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.last_name }}\n- Company: {{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.company_name }}\n- Job Title: {{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.job_title }}\n- Budget: {{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.estimated_budget }}\n- Inquiry Details: \"{{ $node[\"Webhook\"].json.body.inquiry_details }}\"\n\nYour Tasks:\n1. Create a beautifully structured, clean, and professional Slack/Telegram executive alert message in Indonesian. Use professional formatting, emojis, and clear spacing.\n2. Draft a premium, highly persuasive B2B inbound sales response email in English addressed to the client. The tone should be consultative, professional, and invite them to a discovery call. Do not include subject lines or placeholders like [Your Name].\n\nYou MUST respond strictly in a valid JSON format with exactly two keys: \"telegram_alert\" and \"email_draft\". Do not include any markdown wrapper like ```json.\n\nExample structure:\n{\n  \"telegram_alert\": \"text here...\",\n  \"email_draft\": \"text here...\"\n}"
            }
